        "id": "mobile-en-capabilities",
        "title": "Capabilities",
        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--mobile-en-capabilities\">\n\u003csection>\u003cdiv class=\"intro\">\u003cdiv>\u003cspan class=\"eyebrow\">WHAT WE DO\u003c/span>\u003ch2>Connected technology. One experience.\u003c/h2>\u003c/div>\u003cp class=\"intro-single-line\">Hardware, software and brand design come together, from the first screen to the photo in your hand.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"three\">\u003carticle class=\"capability\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Photo booth or kiosk image\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"eyebrow\">HARDWARE\u003c/span>\u003ch3>Hardware for your space\u003c/h3>\u003cp>We build photo booths and kiosks to suit your space and brand.\u003c/p>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"capability\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Capture interface and photo samples\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"eyebrow\">SOFTWARE\u003c/span>\u003ch3>Software for every shot\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Capture, retouch, add frames and print with the features you need.\u003c/p>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"capability\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Branded booth designs and frames\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cspan class=\"eyebrow\">BRAND EXPERIENCE\u003c/span>\u003ch3>Your brand in every photo\u003c/h3>\u003cp>We tailor the booth exterior, capture interface and frames to your brand.\u003c/p>\u003c/article>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
