        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--mobile-en-global\">\n\u003csection>\u003cdiv class=\"global-title mobile-en-global\">FROM KOREA,\u003cbr>BUILT FOR YOUR MARKET.\u003c/div>\u003ch3 class=\"global-subtitle\">Photo booth experiences from Korea, adapted to your market and brand.\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"global-grid\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Actual hardware or approved project images\u003csmall>Caption describing the project and services provided\u003c/small>\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cp>We recommend a setup that fits your local language, payment options, space and brand.\u003c/p>\u003cul class=\"localization-list\" aria-label=\"Localization considerations\">\u003cli>Interface language\u003c/li>\u003cli>Payment options\u003c/li>\u003cli>Installation space\u003c/li>\u003cli>Brand design\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\u003cp class=\"note\">Local payment integration, international shipping and installation arrangements are discussed for each country and project.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"actions\">\u003cbutton type=\"button\" disabled>Explore projects\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
