        "id": "en-applications",
        "title": "Applications",
        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--en-applications\">\n\u003csection>\u003cspan class=\"eyebrow\">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS\u003c/span>\u003ch2>A new photo experience for your business.\u003c/h2>\u003cdiv class=\"applications\">\u003carticle class=\"application\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Store or installation space\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"text\">\u003ch3>Start a photo booth business\u003c/h3>\u003cp>For a new store or an existing space, we provide hardware and software suited to your business.\u003c/p>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" disabled>Explore startup solutions\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"application\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Brand collaboration examples\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"text\">\u003ch3>Custom builds for brands\u003c/h3>\u003cp class=\"brand-collaboration-copy\">Bring your brand or campaign to life through booth design, capture screens and photo frames.\u003c/p>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" disabled>Explore custom builds\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"application\">\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>Store management interface\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"text\">\u003ch3>Manage your franchise\u003c/h3>\u003cp>View sales and device status across your stores in one place.\u003c/p>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" disabled>Explore franchise solutions\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003c/div>\u003cp class=\"scope-line\">Choose a complete setup or the hardware and software you need.\u003c/p>\u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
