        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--startup-types\">\n\u003csection>\u003cspan class=\"eyebrow\">이런 분께 필요합니다\u003c/span>\u003ch2>포토부스 창업과 사업 확장을 준비하시나요?\u003c/h2>\u003cdiv class=\"grid cols-3\">\u003carticle class=\"card\">\u003cdiv class=\"card-copy\">\u003ch3>처음 시작하는 창업\u003c/h3>\u003cp>장비와 공간 준비부터 운영 방법까지 함께 준비하고 싶은 분\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"card\">\u003cdiv class=\"card-copy\">\u003ch3>기존 사업 확장\u003c/h3>\u003cp>운영 중인 사업을 포토부스 비즈니스로 확장하고 싶은 분\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"card\">\u003cdiv class=\"card-copy\">\u003ch3>한 번에 준비하는 창업\u003c/h3>\u003cp>브랜드, 인테리어와 장비를 함께 준비하고 싶은 분\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
        "css": ".mockup-component--startup-types{display:flow-root;width:1280px;max-width:100%;}\n.mockup-component--startup-types,.mockup-component--startup-types *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.mockup-component--startup-types{color:#262626;font-family:\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif}\n.mockup-component--startup-types{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7}\n.mockup-component--startup-types h1,.mockup-component--startup-types h2,.mockup-component--startup-types h3,.mockup-component--startup-types p{margin:0;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word}\n.mockup-component--startup-types h1{font-size:52px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-1.8px;margin-bottom:24px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types h2{font-size:34px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.9px;margin-bottom:22px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.4px;margin-bottom:12px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types p{color:#555}\n.mockup-component--startup-types header{height:100px;padding:0 64px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .logo{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:3px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types nav{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}\n.mockup-component--startup-types button{font:inherit;background:#fff;color:#262626;opacity:1;border:1px solid #666;padding:12px 24px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:default}\n.mockup-component--startup-types nav button{border:0;padding:0;font-size:15px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .solution-nav{padding:20px 64px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbb;display:flex;gap:34px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .solution-nav button{border:0;padding:5px 0;font-size:16px;color:#666}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .solution-nav .current{border-bottom:2px solid #333;color:#222;font-weight:700}\n.mockup-component--startup-types section{padding:68px 64px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .eyebrow{display:block;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#666;margin-bottom:16px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .service-intro{padding:44px 64px 40px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .service-intro h1{font-size:36px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:18px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .service-lead{font-size:20px;color:#333}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .service-detail{font-size:17px;margin-top:8px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .placeholder{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:#f4f4f4;border:1px solid #aaa;height:210px;overflow:hidden}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .placeholder svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;stroke:#c7c7c7;stroke-width:.3;fill:none}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .placeholder span{position:relative;max-width:90%;background:#f4f4f4;padding:10px 18px;font-size:16px;word-break:keep-all}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .placeholder small{display:block;font-size:14px;color:#666;margin-top:8px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .lead{margin-bottom:30px;max-width:1100px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .grid{display:grid;gap:24px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .cols-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .cols-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .card{border:1px solid #aaa;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .card>.placeholder{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .card-copy{padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .card p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;flex:1}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .card button{margin-top:26px;align-self:flex-start}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .card h3{font-size:22px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .note{font-size:16px;margin-top:24px;color:#666;line-height:1.8}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .steps{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--steps),minmax(0,1fr));gap:40px;padding:0;margin:28px 0 0}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .steps li{position:relative;border:1px solid #999;padding:22px 18px;background:#fff}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .steps li:not(:last-child)::after{content:\"→\";position:absolute;right:-33px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:24px;text-align:center;font-size:24px;line-height:1;color:#888}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .steps h3{font-size:20px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .steps p{font-size:16px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:17px;text-align:left}\n.mockup-component--startup-types th,.mockup-component--startup-types td{padding:20px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:top;word-break:keep-all}\n.mockup-component--startup-types thead th{background:#f4f4f4;font-weight:600;border-top:1px solid #aaa}\n.mockup-component--startup-types tbody th{font-weight:600;width:21%}\n.mockup-component--startup-types td{color:#555}\n.mockup-component--startup-types table th:last-child,.mockup-component--startup-types table td:last-child{width:34%}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:start}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .list{list-style:none;margin:25px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .list li{font-size:17px;border-left:2px solid #aaa;padding-left:14px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .role-caption{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:26px;color:#666}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .role-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .role{border:1px solid #aaa;padding:26px;flex:1}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .role h3{margin-bottom:10px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .role p{font-size:17px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .arrow{font-size:25px;color:#999}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .contact{text-align:center;padding:64px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .contact h2{font-size:34px;margin-bottom:16px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .contact p{font-size:18px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types .contact button{margin-top:24px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types footer{padding:42px 64px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types footer .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types footer p{font-size:14px}\n.mockup-component--startup-types footer button{border:0;padding:0;font-size:14px}"
